      "content": "<fullname>Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</fullname> <p>Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling is designed to automatically launch and terminate EC2 instances based on user-defined scaling policies, scheduled actions, and health checks.</p> <p>For more information, see the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/userguide/\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide</a> and the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/autoscaling/ec2/APIReference/Welcome.html\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling API Reference</a>.</p>\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Mike Ralphson\n Email: mike.ralphson@gmail.com",
